    "content": "كيفية تثبيت أو إلغاء تثبيت Swing Catalyst تصف هذه مقالة الدعم كيفية تثبيت أو إلغاء تثبيت Swing Catalyst*.\n*ينطبق على: Motion Catalyst.\nBefore you install Swing Catalyst on a new computer, please make sure that the computer meets our recommended computer specifications / requirements.\nNote: Swing Catalyst does not work on Apple hardware (Apple M1, M2, or newer variants that use ARM architecture).\nThis article also assumes you have a valid license (for the version you wish to install) and have the license readily available.\nDownloading the latest version The latest version of Swing Catalyst can be downloaded from our downloads page.\nClick the “Download” button.\nOnce the installer has downloaded, double click the exe file (usually in your Downloads folder).\nCheck the license agreement check box and click “Install”.\nClick “Yes” to the elevated access prompt.\nClick “Close” once installation has completed.\nHow to uninstall Swing Catalyst Go to Windows Settings. Right click on the Windows icon on the Task bar , and select Settings\nIn Settings, click on Apps, then scroll down to you see Swing Catalyst, or type Swing in the search bar.\nClick on Swing Catalyst then click Uninstall.\nClick Yes and follow the on screen instructions.\n1. 2. Last updated: 2023-12-13 | View on official support site",
